ction Radio Show #549","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-549.jpg","content":"A mix from Joe Kay’s vault filled with classic R&B gems.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-05-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"twH7w0ElT7c","position":12,"timestamp":"00:14:57","rawTrack":"Busta Rhymes - Woo Hah!! Got You All In Check","track":{"id":"XdS1GGg6fpU","path":"/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/woo-hah-got-you-all-in-check/","slug":"woo-hah-got-you-all-in-check","title":"Woo Hah!! Got You All In Check","artist":{"slug":"busta-rhymes","title":"Busta Rhymes"},"artwork":"images/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/woo-hah-got-you-all-in-check.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"JVZNWJkTDaw","slug":"549","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-549/ra.1622527891","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-549"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #549","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-549.jpg","content":"A mix from Joe Kay’s vault filled with classic R&B gems.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-05-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"MrATWddVSzA","position":6,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Busta Rhymes - What’s It Gonna Be?! (feat. Janet)","track":{"id":"oVotnh0Ihlg","path":"/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/what-s-it-gonna-be-feat-janet/","slug":"whats-it-gonna-be-feat-janet","title":"What's It Gonna Be?! (feat. Janet)","artist":{"slug":"busta-rhymes","title":"Busta Rhymes"},"artwork":"images/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/what-s-it-gonna-be-feat-janet.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-139-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"H1q6Y3jvHYE","position":22,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Busta Rhymes - What's It Gonna Be ft. Janet Jackson (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"BZEA0jEv-IA","path":"/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/what-s-it-gonna-be-ft-janet-jackson-instrumental/","slug":"whats-it-gonna-be-ft-janet-jackson-instrumental","title":"What's It Gonna Be ft. Janet Jackson (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"busta-rhymes","title":"Busta Rhymes"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"BlOya53xZP0","position":36,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Busta Rhymes - What It Is ft. Kelis (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"TB-nXCwdL1o","path":"/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/what-it-is-ft-kelis-instrumental/","slug":"what-it-is-ft-kelis-instrumental","title":"What It Is ft. Kelis (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"busta-rhymes","title":"Busta Rhymes"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"2dVRfkYMblA","slug":"142","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-142-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #142 w/ Kloud","artwork":"/images/episodes/142.jpg","content":"Co-founder of The Melt \"Kloud\" spins a diverse set of house, R&B, soul, 2-step and bass.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10816,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-24T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"IWNR3dpEgHc","position":77,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Busta Rhymes - I Know What You Want (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"d52nPoc9KFU","path":"/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/i-know-what-you-want-instrumental/","slug":"i-know-what-you-want-instrumental","title":"I Know What You Want (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"busta-rhymes","title":"Busta Rhymes"},"artwork":"images/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/i-know-what-you-want-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"9-Yz4-nLIFw","position":9,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Busta Rhymes - Everything Remains Raw","track":{"id":"DbIvCtlqIB4","path":"/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/everything-remains-raw/","slug":"everything-remains-raw","title":"Everything Remains Raw","artist":{"slug":"busta-rhymes","title":"Busta Rhymes"},"artwork":"images/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/everything-remains-raw.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"MUTAwmt5Mm0","slug":"173","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-173"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #173","artwork":"/images/episodes/173.jpg","content":"Joe Kay makes it to the studio in time to throw down an unforgettable set full of primarily forgotten classics that will have you reminiscing on life.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAs if this news isn't enough, we just hit 100K here on Soundcloud this past Friday literally while we launched our new residency @ the legendary Echoplex! Talk about timing and accomplishments. THANK you to each and every one of you for supporting us and spreading this sound to everyone. We plan to give you something really soon to celebrate 100K supporters worldwide and more. Big ups to the 900+ people who showed up to The Sound of Tomorrow this past Friday. Very inspiring.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10836,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-05-03T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"4NNvqbSG6GE","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTra